<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49641" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ūlīgĭnōsus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		uligo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>full of moisture</i>, <i>wet</i>, <i>moist</i>, <i>damp</i>, <i>marshy</i> (syn. umidus): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">locus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 6, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">campi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					2, 4, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 5, 3, § 33</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caprile,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 3, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">viscera,</span>”
				i. e. <i>dropsical</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Arn. 1, 30</span></i>
			.—<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ūlīgĭnōsa</span></b> ,
				ōrum, n. (sc. loca), <i>swamps</i>, <i>marshes</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 36,
				23, 55, § 176</span></i>.</div>
